# Shell scripts run on Linux and NAS hosts, so keep LF in the repository
# regardless of the committer's platform or core.autocrlf setting. A CRLF
# shebang makes the kernel look for "/usr/bin/env bash\r" and fail.
# 这些脚本运行在 Linux / NAS 上，仓库中必须保持 LF，不受提交者平台或
# core.autocrlf 影响。shebang 若带 CR 会导致内核找不到解释器。
*.sh text eol=lf

# PowerShell scripts only ever run on Windows.
*.ps1 text eol=crlf

# Snapshots and media must never be rewritten by line-ending conversion.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.apk binary
